# BeeFS disk: files and settings survive a reboot; boot counter goes up.
@disk
$ about
filesystem: BeeFS on ATA disk
$ cat /system/boot_count
1
$ mkdir /home/bee
$ echo "remember me" > /home/bee/note.txt
$ layout us
keyboard layout: English (US) (saved)
@reboot
$ cat /system/boot_count
2
$ cat /system/boot.log
boot #1
boot #2
$ cat /home/bee/note.txt
remember me
$ layout
~ ^ \* us\s+English \(US\)
